WEBVTT

00:33:28.496 --> 00:33:31.829
My mother's dead. My first
marriage is over.

00:33:31.829 --> 00:33:36.996
This man I loved but got married
too young and I'm an orphan and

00:33:36.996 --> 00:33:39.579
I need to make my life I'm
going to make my life.

00:33:40.038 --> 00:33:43.121
And part of that, obviously, for
a writer is about language.

00:33:43.121 --> 00:33:45.413
And Cheryl Niland just
didn't feel like me.

00:33:45.954 --> 00:33:48.746
And so I came up with my own
last name, Cheryl Strayed.

00:33:48.746 --> 00:33:49.871
What's so funny to me now?

00:33:49.871 --> 00:33:54.413
So I've been Cheryl strayed longer than
I was anything else. Now I'm 51.

00:33:54.996 --> 00:33:58.496
People still say like, oh, but Cheryl
Strayed is not your real name.

00:33:58.496 --> 00:34:01.829
And I'm like, Cheryl Strayed is
the realest name I ever had.